1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
PolicyWatcher Beta 27 connects public policy evidence with the operational checks required before publication.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:17,000
The workflow starts with deterministic priorities. Each item identifies severity, cause, evidence timestamp, affected records, stated impact and one responsible destination.

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Publication readiness is divided into five stages: Configured, Retrieved, Baseline verified, Public and Analysed. Numerators, the shared denominator and excluded records remain visible.

4
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:34,000
A missing scan or unavailable metric is never converted into zero or a healthy state.

5
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Independent status cards provide bounded evidence for Dataset QA, database readiness, webhook delivery and VPS services. Administrators reach operational controls; auditors receive read-only verification routes.

6
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:55,000
The public platform keeps source links, timestamps, methodology, Claim Registry entries, release records and correction routes available for inspection.

7
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Its configured inventory records 16 companies across six sectors. The framework defines 15 canonical KPIs across privacy, AI governance and ethics.

8
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:13,000
These figures describe configured scope. They are not exhaustive coverage, legal advice, compliance certification or independent validation.

9
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Pulse adds reviewed leads, deterministic Story Packs, citations, social cards and embeddable evidence visuals.

10
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Inspect the evidence, limitations, dated assets and release audit at policywatcher.online/press-kit.
